title: "Exact Timing Boundaries and Modular Integrity Checks for 5G NR Numerologies"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
authors:
  - family-names: Valeris
    given-names: Reinaldo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-8056-1113"
    affiliation: "Universidad Jose Gregorio Hernandez"
  - family-names: Matheus
    given-names: Gustavo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8394-4418"
    affiliation: "Instituto Universitario Politecnico Santiago Marino"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible derivation of exact normal-cyclic-prefix slot boundaries for
  5G NR numerologies, a rigorous distinction between abstract slot-index
  groups and physical boundary sets, and a bounded analysis of residue-vector
  timing-integrity checks with Python and VHDL reference implementations.
keywords:
  - 5G NR
  - cyclic prefix
  - modular arithmetic
  - numerology
  - timing integrity
